    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3181790/extras/646af9295438be1344e9a98f19255e0b.avif?t=1749398500\" data-has-big width=800 height=141 /></span>Souper Game is a fun and spicy clicker where you play as... SOUP! That's right\u2014an irresistible, hot, and aromatic soup that the elven girl Sylvie prepares for the rude and insatiable Troll. Your mission? Not only to become the perfect dish but also to earn her affection!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3181790/extras/2c6d27d4e124c02b7b4cf869627f988f.avif?t=1749398500\" data-has-big width=800 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3181790/extras/5c0575e42d7e63f19d6f431c90859522.avif?t=1749398500\" data-has-big width=800 height=69 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3181790/extras/5324b86dc022fca0cdfb36f669b9eebe.poster.avif?t=1749398500\" width=800 height=396 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3181790/extras/5324b86dc022fca0cdfb36f669b9eebe.webm?t=1749398500\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3181790/extras/f50129719e8e8b52fd0bc04aa2f077d1.avif?t=1749398500\" data-has-big width=800 height=69 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3181790/extras/dd34b4050a7909978a651da42b754b2f.poster.avif?t=1749398500\" width=800 height=314 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3181790/extras/dd34b4050a7909978a651da42b754b2f.webm?t=1749398500\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3181790/extras/22ce28237231ad66f193f461f59130dd.avif?t=1749398500\" data-has-big width=800 height=69 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3181790/extras/1fc6018b4e7a97bdbc7060463a8e72fa.poster.avif?t=1749398500\" width=800 height=504 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3181790/extras/1fc6018b4e7a97bdbc7060463a8e72fa.webm?t=1749398500\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you whip up the ideal soup, stand your ground against the Troll, and avoid becoming his lunch? Welcome to the world where even soup can be a passionate hero! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3181790/extras/6820aa7d318f40bc7e416b77fef1abaa.avif?t=1749398500\" data-has-big width=800 height=141 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3181790/extras/259ceddc8216970a65865324296e81ca.webp?t=1749398500\" width=15 height=13 /></span>\u00a0Secret, magical, and rare ingredients that pack a punch with unexpected effects. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3181790/extras/259ceddc8216970a65865324296e81ca.webp?t=1749398500\" width=15 height=13 /></span>\u00a0A colorful cast of enemies, each with their own unique attacks. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3181790/extras/259ceddc8216970a65865324296e81ca.webp?t=1749398500\" width=15 height=13 /></span>\u00a0Fearsome bosses with mechanics that will keep you on your toes. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3181790/extras/259ceddc8216970a65865324296e81ca.webp?t=1749398500\" width=15 height=13 /></span>\u00a0Three branching storylines shaped by how you upgrade your soup. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3181790/extras/259ceddc8216970a65865324296e81ca.webp?t=1749398500\" width=15 height=13 /></span>\u00a0Spicy interactions with Sylvie. How spicy? That\u2019s a secret... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3181790/extras/259ceddc8216970a65865324296e81ca.webp?t=1749398500\" width=15 height=13 /></span>\u00a0Dive into an interactive world\u2014explore, click, and uncover delightful surprises!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3181790/extras/259ceddc8216970a65865324296e81ca.webp?t=1749398500\" width=15 height=13 /></span>\u00a0Multiple endings...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3181790/extras/259ceddc8216970a65865324296e81ca.webp?t=1749398500\" width=15 height=13 /></span>  Streamer Mode!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3181790/extras/e011ffd091cf00db81834141d77ca990.avif?t=1749398500\" data-has-big width=800 height=150 /></span></p>",
